  bosonic oscillator mode under an ideal number-resolving count model. It is a
  model-defined normal-ordered moment for states with finite moments and
  positive mean number. No multimode output-field correlation, finite-trial
  observation, detector response, or laboratory antibunching result is
  asserted.
